<p>Hits the target doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">72%, 81%, 88%, 94%, 100%</acronym> damage and trying to disarm the target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. The chance improves with your Physical Power.</p>